,{"stars":4,"amount":10226},{"stars":5,"amount":16926}],"rating":4.1,"reviews":35480,"pricing":{"for_date":{"start":"2026-10-12","end":"2026-10-13"}},"unclaimed_listing":true,"type":["Night club"],"description":"Rustic-chic venue on the beach with rooftop seating, offering Goan dishes, cocktails & club nights.","unsupported_extensions":[{"accessibility":["Wheelchair-accessible car park","Wheelchair-accessible entrance","Wheelchair-accessible seating"]}],"address":"H.No 779/2 st Michael Vaddo Before Curlies Zululand Cottage, Monteiro Vaddo, Anjuna, Goa 403509","country":"India","phone":"095452 12336","plus_code":"HP9R+QV Anjuna, Goa","location_summary":{"neighborhood":{"title":"Monteiro Vaddo","data_id":"0x3bbfe989d0dd3707:0xcd367aa733267612","data_cid":"14787141285053888018","place_id":"ChIJBzfd0InpvzsREnYmM6d6Ns0"},"description":"Laid-back area with water sports & food shacks at Anjuna Beach, plus a sprawling weekly flea market.","ratings":{"total":{"value":3.2259543645165665,"verdict":"Good for visitors"},"proximity_to_things_to_do":{"value":4.552615023040505,"verdict":"Excellent"},"proximity_to_transit":{"value":0,"verdict":"Not great"},"airport_access":{"value":2.988849614771439,"verdict":"Good"}}},"user_reviews":{"summary":[{"snippet":"\"Good view Good staff but a bit late service Okay food Okay music Good ambience\"","thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXo8rrDxjc0qPW08PsHMIn0vjocxXGLTXjHN6FLdgAojqnyGjlQgA=s40-k-cc-rp-mo"},{"snippet":"\"Great place to eat yummy snacks/starters and enjoy a beer!\"","thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWxx5FFlEgkdiKdYkbNykIbSNTBOn6Lo_Ld68pzcgvyFS2LWqj=s40-k-cc-rp-mo"},{"snippet":"\"We ordered drinks, chicken masala, tandoori roti, and brownie with ice cream.\"","thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKKQYY_cZ4tHcpgVI47O-DweiXe9OrLaEF2jt7ZLCstwasH2_S=s40-k-cc-rp-mo"}],"most_relevant":[{"username":"Arkadeep Mondal","rating":2,"contributor_id":"111641495039315121149","user_review_count":65,"user_photo_count":142,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5MF07tpSFRSXu9J-JMv48caRpGMB5JdD13xne4vH5MbQxTmxgPg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"Great ambience and an amazing view! 🌴🌊\n\nHad a really pleasant stay at Curlies Shack Hotel. The ambience is relaxed, vibrant, and perfect for a beach getaway. The location and sea view are definitely the highlights, making it a great place to unwind and enjoy the surroundings.\n\nThe food was decent but could be better in terms of taste and variety. Overall, though, it was a positive experience, especially for the vibe, location, and beautiful views. Would definitely consider visiting again!","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ndGFqSmpUV1V0VUVsVlluVndZVVpTVlUwd05YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1f949df8c252d491!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOngtajJjTWUtUElVYnVwYUZSVU0wNXc%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeAa4XHD2uQDaMZr2RtjG6GM3FJ0bQbXsfG-ouMbFXx2yz__xB7nwxM2-tbeOKJa5tFMnlfuNIh0TFlqBmQwRoFZ6pV9umP3vQt85CtlK3RHz3_Avw0GP4h274fPa2pPiS-vxg7BKcTnEV2=k-no"}],"date":"a month ago","date_iso8601":"2026-09-02T12:58:51+00:00"},{"username":"vishal sehgal","rating":5,"contributor_id":"102369149241770658339","user_review_count":108,"user_photo_count":69,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXW9dKzqKEPlHL7DO8NmEtUJ-fjqdVi0RzM_wT0og6Ka1BJ762r-Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"Curlies is one of those iconic Goa spots that truly lives up to the hype! The breathtaking sea view, relaxed beach vibe, and stunning sunsets make it a place you'll never forget.\n\nWhat impressed me the most was the food. It's one of the few restaurants in Goa that isn't afraid to serve genuinely spicy and flavourful dishes. Every meal was fresh, delicious, and full of taste. Enjoying amazing food while listening to the sound of the waves was an unforgettable experience.\n\nThe atmosphere is vibrant yet cozy, making it perfect for couples, friends, or anyone looking to experience the real spirit of Goa. If you're visiting Anjuna, Curlies is an absolute must visit. Great food, incredible views, and unforgettable vibes I'll definitely be coming back!","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sMU5FSnhRMU4wZFhabGRVcHhRVzh5TFhKVE0zYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1f949df8c252d491!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnl1NEJxQ1N0dXZldUpxQW8yLXJTM3c%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeVur4K811FSwM1DUpyeinIXqz_EvvPd_4sbun9pCZC48nBaOQ330I7z4GS7oUHsZRB7VjFp-lJWN1cxnasigKCprK5NKNC2OUp_puVYEAt8tcEgAMofOLYHlxQ25_MEmGnt_Ap3AN19RFr=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcHd-7UFA_PVoQ0yV4kg_K5u1rFjxKNK32XYOckmiJ6T5UL9gKoCGgELZJtp_F30Jj4zCiJ-LYI7hiHOmkPHBRJzQ5Tun59SnwloHb5rlcmfNkq-3iapIiJpq8RvMqPC1d246DI04g5xPlh=k-no"}],"date":"2 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-07-09T14:49:25+00:00"},{"username":"Shivam Gupta","rating":5,"contributor_id":"101627226326114487193","user_review_count":51,"user_photo_count":182,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwbY1J3mjgjRa_FIbtpRO81R6m2m-2YkJADHRfqPVu5sTS_iSm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"A little difficult to reach this beachside club, but once you get there, it’s totally worth it. Amazing views, decent food, and very helpful staff. Definitely recommended, especially in the evening or at night. The only thing missing was Bollywood music would’ve made the vibe even better, but unfortunately the DJ didn’t play it.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xd1RtcDBWRmRtTVVOaVdGcDNMVWRCYjFoVmVsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1f949df8c252d491!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1wTmp0VFdmMUNiWFp3LUdBb1hVelE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","date":"a month ago","date_iso8601":"2026-08-30T12:15:50+00:00"},{"username":"Priyanka Joshi","rating":5,"contributor_id":"105149834754471899622","user_review_count":194,"user_photo_count":619,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmWKS-6hLhOSn4Y-8Qus8vg1DlWhGZBCGYv_Qm2Wcz1sZ5ahE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"This shack is right on the beach. We went during the monsoon season and the weather was absolutely windy yet pleasant. We got an awesome table and couldn't get out of this shack as it kept us holding back for the next tide approaching the shack's wall. The food was tasty and the drinks were good too.\n\nThe staff is courteous and fast at their service.\n\nDisclaimer : They charge 22% VAT on liquor.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWk1USXRaMGt5VTNkS1UxbGZWSGx5YlVSTlFrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1f949df8c252d491!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhZMTItZ0kyU3dKU1lfVHlybURNQkE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","date":"3 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-07-06T13:05:01+00:00"},{"username":"Surya Kiran","rating":4,"contributor_id":"106185254791595763093","user_review_count":25,"user_photo_count":19,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXq5xoAb14wSoCezw733EkMfmS9yuE9pUsm-CNA7m81qqCk0qiM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"The place has a great vibe, good food, and a beautiful beachfront location. The sunset view in the evening is absolutely amazing and is definitely worth experiencing.\n\nHowever, the service needs significant improvement. Orders take a long time to arrive, and the staff are not very responsive or attentive when assistance is needed.\n\nApart from the service, everything else was enjoyable. If you’re looking to relax, enjoy the beach, and watch a stunning sunset, this place is worth visiting. I would recommend going in the evening for the best experience.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjdFdreHJZbEU0WjBKeWJIbHZVMlo1WDBsRGRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1f949df8c252d491!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlctWkxrYlE4Z0JybHlvU2Z5X0lDdUE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thu